WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.530
- So the big news over the weekend,

00:00:01.530 --> 00:00:04.530
and it's crazy that the news
cycle has basically moved on,

00:00:04.530 --> 00:00:06.700
is that President Trump
tried to work with insiders

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:09.300
in the DOJ to basically launch a coup

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.270
inside the Department of Justice.

00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:13.320
President Trump worked
with the acting head

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:15.330
of the Civil Division, Jeffrey Clark,

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:18.640
to oust the acting attorney
general, Jeffrey Rosen,

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:20.570
and basically try and shoehorn

00:00:20.570 --> 00:00:24.130
all of his crazy conspiracy
theories through the DOJ.

00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:25.830
On top of that, it appears
that Trump was trying

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:27.860
to strong arm the DOJ into filing suits

00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:30.250
with the Supreme Court to try
and overturn the election.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:31.900
And the only reason it
appears it didn't work

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:35.260
is that members of the DOJ
threatened to resign en masse

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:36.760
to prevent this from happening.

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:38.050
And they thought that the fallout

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:39.670
from the mass resignations would be worse

00:00:39.670 --> 00:00:41.320
than the actual actions itself.

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:43.360
Just when you thought it
couldn't get any worse,

00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:45.520
it gets worse, but stay tuned.

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:47.933
And as always, I will see you in court.

